every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://PropertyJSON/documentation/PropertyJSON":{"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/propertyjson","identifier":"doc:\/\/PropertyJSON\/documentation\/PropertyJSON","title":"PropertyJSON","abstract":[{"text":"The vendor-neutral pieces a JSON ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BatchEncoder"},{"text":" is built from: properties, context, timestamps, identity and batch splitting.","type":"text"}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/TrackingFromViews":{"kind":"article","title":"Tracking from SwiftUI, UIKit and AppKit","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/trackingfromviews","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/TrackingFromViews","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Give views the tracker the way each framework passes values down, and let modifiers and controls track what views do."}],"role":"article"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/SessionsAndStandardContext":{"role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Sessions and Standard Context","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with its session and with the app, device, system, locale and network it was tracked on."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/SessionsAndStandardContext"},"doc://Traffluent/documentation/Traffluent/WhatGoesWhere":{"role":"article","type":"topic","title":"Logging, Tracing, Metrics and Analytics","kind":"article","url":"\/documentation\/traffluent\/whatgoeswhere","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Four signals, four jobs. Decide which one a fact belongs to before you write the line that records it."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Traffluent\/documentation\/Traffluent\/WhatGoesWhere"},"doc://